<title>USA: Cox Radio gets FCC okay on KRTO-FM purchase.</title>
<headline>Cox Radio gets FCC okay on KRTO-FM purchase.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA, Ga. 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cox Radio Inc said Friday it has received approval by the Federal Communications Commission to complete its previously announced deal to acquire KRTO-FM in Los Angeles.</p>
<p>The radio station will be acquired from El Dorado Communications for $19 million and the deal is expectred to close by the end of May, Cox Radio said.</p>
<p>Cox, one of the 10 largest radio broadcasting companies in the U.S., currently owns three Los Angeles radio stations.</p>
</text>
